a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/959455-the-young-man-in-the-cafe-s-savannah-georgia-setting-writeup\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> <br /> My heroes as monster tamers rules for BtP can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/975230-heroes-as-monster-tamers-rules-ideas\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":3932,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","user":"The young man in the cafe","date":". 07-30-2017, 01:16 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","name":"The young man in the cafe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3932_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-03T07:21:27-07:00","id":1124287,"title":"","content":"The Court of the American Dream Factory<br /> <br /> This court originated in LA in the 1940s, and began slowly moving into Georgia in the 90s due to the increasing media presence in the state. The court's operations in Savannah are mostly based around SCAD, urging up and coming creators to make projects that increase the court's influence over mortals, though they also work to bring film and TV projects to the city. The court is allied with the uratha of the Lodge of the Silver Screen, who serve the The Director, a powerful Dihar of the american movie and TV industries who is also the leader of the court.<br /> <br /> Example spirit to come soon<br /> <br /> Court Ban: Spirits of this court can not harm or effect anyone holding a valuable and well cared for piece of movie or tv history, such as a prop from a famous series or a original copy of a script signed by an actor from the work in question.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Despite the user name I am actually bigender.<br /> <br /> My Savannah Setting for CofD can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/959455-the-young-man-in-the-cafe-s-savannah-georgia-setting-writeup\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> <br /> My heroes as monster tamers rules for BtP can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/975230-heroes-as-monster-tamers-rules-ideas\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","name":"The young man in the cafe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3932_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-05T12:14:41-07:00","id":1125302,"title":"","content":"Delayed reaction:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The young man in the cafe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/959455-the-young-man-in-the-cafe-s-savannah-georgia-setting-writeup?p=959579#post959579\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The bomb didn't detonate, but the casing cracked and the radiation from the bomb and the Monazite sand that naturally occurs there created a Zeke (sic) from the corpse of a drowned man. The Zeke was eventually chased out of Savannah by TFV but he stayed in Georgia long enough to write an extensive ramble that was later put in the Georgia Historic Society Secret History Division's special collection. Any Promethean who wants to read it can, in exchange for a small favor, though the small favors have a habit of growing much bigger than expected.</div> </div> </div> </div>So you'd already worked all that out long before you <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/showthread.php?796641-CoFD-Sir-Night-Compiles-Night-Horrors-Conquering-Heroes-(In-Character-Let-s-Read)&amp;p=21221009#post21221009\" target=\"_blank\">mentioned</a> him on the &quot;Sir Night Compiles <b>Night Horrors: Conquering Heroes</b>&quot; thread? Cool beans!<br /> <br /> Also cool that we turned out on the same page about him being an Extempore (making it lucky for Coppelia that he left a written record for that part of his Ramble, since it wouldn't be in Azothic memory). I was already going to make that official that in her next post (which will be heavy on filling in some of the gaps in Night's overview of the Created condition), but it's good to know I'm not stepping on your toes particularly. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1426-aberranteyes","name":"AberrantEyes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1426_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"45"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-27T13:21:40-07:00","id":1144523,"title":"","content":"and here is the next court<br /> <br /> Court of the Grey Phoenix<br /> <br /> Court Ban: if a monument to the confederacy is destroyed, the spirits of this court in the city lose all their will power until it is rebuilt. If a lesser relic of the confederacy is destroyed, all spirits of this court in the scene lose their willpower for the remainder of the scene.<br /> <br /> This court, which originated during Reconstruction, represents the nostalgia for the old south, and the racial issues resulting from that nostalgia. This court, led by the Grey Phoenix spirit of the same name, is most influential in that one of it's members is currently urging Chatham county's Sheriff Wilcher, who has had multiple black men die, be raped or otherwise abused in his jail <a href=\"http://savannahnow.com/crime-courts-politics-news/2017-01-14/no-comment-sheriff-blocking-health-monitors-chatham-county\" target=\"_blank\">and at point blocked health monitors from inspecting the jail </a>with the goal of claiming him and his deputies. The court also has ties to the local Seers of the Throne and some of the Ivory Claw families in the city, though the inter-generational conflicts in the tribe have been threatening that particular alliance as of late, and the younger claws actions against the seers have also caused trouble..<br /> <br /> The court also tries, with little success so far, to discredit the BLM chapter in Savannah, which has proven resistant to such efforts by the court and it's minions due to their intentionally moderate activism, and the fact that many of the pastors that make up the local BLM's leadership are under the protection of the Pentacle and a pack of forsaken anticonfederate southerners called the Anderson Street Scalawags .<br /> <br /> And of course, the confederate monument in forsyth park is their main locus, and their achilles heel.<br /> <br /> Oh and Wilcher sometimes rents out inmates as blood dolls for local vampires in exchange for &quot;services rendered&quot; that only a vampire could provide.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Despite the user name I am actually bigender.<br /> <br /> My Savannah Setting for CofD can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/959455-the-young-man-in-the-cafe-s-savannah-georgia-setting-writeup\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> <br /> My heroes as monster tamers rules for BtP can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/975230-heroes-as-monster-tamers-rules-ideas\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":3932,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","user":"The young man in the cafe","date":". 09-27-2017, 04:32 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","name":"The young man in the cafe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3932_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-22T05:53:46-08:00","id":1161485,"title":"","content":"Story hook time! Invictus leader Clark Kruger\u2019s project to gentrify the Starland District south of Forsyth Park has hit an unexpected snag, his sire has awakened from the torpor that he entered in the 50s. You see, the sire ( an elder who was one of the native yamacraw in life and embraced centuries before Savannah was founded) gave Kruger the area right before he went to the long sleep, and back then the area was going through a rapid decline and the elder saw no reason to keep the territory. of course now that it\u2019s a hip artsy neighborhood then elder wants it back. Krueger has thus assigned your coterie to come up with a way to somehow convince his sire to back off before things turn ugly.<br /> <br /> Of course the elder has a counter offer for your coterie, help him dust Kruger and he will teach you a devotion that only he knows, one that would make spying on rivals in the tunnels much easier","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Despite the user name I am actually bigender.<br /> <br /> My Savannah Setting for CofD can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/959455-the-young-man-in-the-cafe-s-savannah-georgia-setting-writeup\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> <br /> My heroes as monster tamers rules for BtP can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/975230-heroes-as-monster-tamers-rules-ideas\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":3932,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","user":"The young man in the cafe","date":". 11-22-2017, 08:57 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","name":"The young man in the cafe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3932_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-16T21:32:08-08:00","id":1168303,"title":"","content":"Because of Half Damned<br /> <br /> Savannah's revenants share a burrow in the form of a cluster of sunken ships in the ocean just outside the river, keeping a blood farm in the form of a fish farm. The Forgotten Fleet, as the burrow is known, is led by a revenant Known simply as The Forgotten Sailor, who claims to be a crew man of the Confederate Submarine the Hunley, who survived the sinking of the sub, only to wash up on one of the barrier islands, where his even more unknown sire embraced him. Savannah's kindred (and most revenants for that matter) would prefer not to deal with the sailor and his racist views, except that his covey has a tap on the undesea internet cable running from Savannah to all along the